{"sections":[{"slug":"Trinitarianism","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Trinitarianism"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">三位一体</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"三位一体"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">三位一体</span></strong> (Trinitarianism) <span lang=\"zh\">形容的是如下三个数学分支在许多场合具有深刻的联系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">以至于可以视为同一基础现象的三个视角</span>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">计算</span> / <span lang=\"zh\">编程</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">研究</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">数据类型</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">程序</span></strong>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">逻辑</span> / <span lang=\"zh\">形式化数学</span> / <span lang=\"zh\">类型论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">研究</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">研究</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span></strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}}}]}